				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13408113/theosis#post-4783519</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2020 21:34:36 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Asdfaslas</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5335699</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>If they can't see, how do they know the colour left their grandfather's face?</p> <p>Maybe a more blind-friendly sign of his fear should be mentioned instead. An awkward pause. A series of small gasps as they relate the story. Grabbing his grandchild's hands and holding them tight. Something unrelated to sight.</p> <p>Because even if something happened related to their grandfather's appearance, they wouldn't know about it.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
